  "post_content": "<p>Ayer domingo un grupo de vecinos de Tales, entre los que se encontraba el alcalde, Ambrosio Ram&iacute;rez, y varios concejales repitieron la romer&iacute;a al Rac&oacute; de Sant Francesc, que ya se hizo en julio del a&ntilde;o pasado para conmemorar&nbsp; los 25 a&ntilde;os de este paraje religioso.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4194.jpg\" alt=\"img_4194\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4195.jpg\" alt=\"img_4195\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4196.jpg\" alt=\"img_4196\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4197.jpg\" alt=\"img_4197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4198.jpg\" alt=\"img_4198\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4199.jpg\" alt=\"img_4199\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4200.jpg\" alt=\"img_4200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4201.jpg\" alt=\"img_4201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4202.jpg\" alt=\"img_4202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4203.jpg\" alt=\"img_4203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriatales/img_4204.jpg\" alt=\"img_4204\"